title: "Wind Utility Data Platform: Sizing & Cost Model"
description: >
  How much data does a 500-turbine wind utility generate?
  What does it really cost on Databricks — and is that justified?
  Tweak the assumptions and rerun: cm eval wind-utility-sizing.cm -v
